    "body": "https://bug1244480.bmoattachments.org/attachment.cgi?id=8716020 has Gecko tests which should be converted to web-platform-tests.\r\n\r\n`document.createElement(\"canvas\").getContext(\"2d\", {get alpha() { throw 1 }})` would also be good to include somehow and maybe some `OffscreenCanvas` object tests even though that doesn't seem to be implemented yet?\r\n\r\nI could not think of a way to make converting an IDL value to an ECMAScript value throw. Suggestions?\r\n\r\ncc @whatwg/canvas ",
