    "body": "The WebGL spec defines getContextAttributes() to return a WebGLContextAttributes dictionary https://www.khronos.org/registry/webgl/specs/latest/1.0/#5.2 .\r\n\r\nCanvasRenderingContext2D or ImageBitmapRenderingContext could define a similar method with a different return type with no collisions, since there is no common super-interface. RenderingContext is a union typedef rather than a super-interface. https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/canvas.html#the-canvas-element",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
